  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ee47400ad7846ea",
      "translationZh": "使用相同的提示词（4081 tokens）和相同的参数，仅改变上下文大小：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6911bfa0236b2f2e",
      "translationZh": "上下文大小为 131072 时，pp 为 778.91 t/s，tg 为 40.68 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "debb31632ffb2003",
      "translationZh": "上下文大小为 65536 时，pp 为 137.87 t/s，tg 为 13.36 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb0a4f90c9d4e565",
      "translationZh": "使用 RX 9070 XT，全部卸载到 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d29e91bb3938bd4",
      "translationZh": "根据这块 GPU 的规格，上下文大小为 131072 时的 pp 778.91 t/s 和 tg 40.68 t/s 似乎才是正常表现。但我想知道，为什么在这些参数下，65536 的性能下降这么多。使用 65536 的上下文大小时，我违反了什么规则吗？训练时的上下文大小 262144 能被 65536 整除，所以我想不出原因了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "186048283f8b86c1",
      "translationZh": "这似乎是个 bug，如果我把 -ub 改成 1024 或 128，65k 的上下文就能正常工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "229e3a3c41ad41f5",
      "translationZh": "我先用 1024 测试，速度恢复了正常。为了确认这不只是增大 -ub 带来的结果，我又把 -ub 降到 128，速度也同样正常。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bac02b54b83e13e9",
      "translationZh": "默认值会引发这个 bug，真是遗憾。我在微调配置时会更加小心，测试多个不同的值似乎是个好习惯，甚至也要试着减小 -ub，虽然对于新款 GPU 来说，这样的配置有些反直觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8cf9e2be890c495",
      "translationZh": "我会尝试研究 llama.cpp 的代码，寻找这种奇怪行为的原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
